{"title": "Backgrounds (Legacy)", "pageid": 48378, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Backgrounds_(Legacy)", "categories": ["Legacy content"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r349439\">.mw-parser-output .ambox{margin:20px 10%;border-left:10px solid #969696;box-sizing:border-box}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-image-div{width:40px}.mw-parser-output table.ambox+table.ambox,.mw-parser-output table.ambox+link+table.ambox,.mw-parser-output table.ambox+style+table.ambox{margin-top:-1px}.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-empty-cell{border:none;padding:0;width:1px}.mw-parser-output .ambox th.mbox-text,.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-text{border:none;padding:0.25em 0.5em;width:100%}.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-image{padding:2px 0 2px 0.5em;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-imageright{padding:2px 0.5em 2px 0;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-notice{border-left-color:#969696}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-speedy{background-color:#400805}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-speedy,.mw-parser-output table.ambox-delete{border-left-color:#b50000}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-content{border-left-color:#de5f16}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-style{border-left-color:#f0c146}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-protection{border-left-color:#4f4a39}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-move{border-left-color:#587cd1}html body.mediawiki .mw-parser-output .ambox.mbox-small{clear:right;float:right;margin:4px 0 4px 1em;box-sizing:border-box;width:238px;font-size:88%;line-height:1.25em}html body.mediawiki .mw-parser-output .ambox.mbox-small-left{margin:4px 1em 4px 0;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;width:238px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:88%;line-height:1.25em}</style><table class=\"ambox ambox-notice plainlinks metadata\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div style=\"width:52px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about gameplay elements – such as characters, quests or mechanics – that have been <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Legacy_content\" title=\"Category:Legacy content\">removed from the game</a> and are <b>no longer available</b>.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The following <a href=\"/wiki/Backgrounds\" title=\"Backgrounds\">backgrounds</a> existed in pre-release versions of the game, but were removed in the final version of the game. While their art and text can be found in the game files, they are not usable by characters.\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Removed_and_unused\">Removed and unused</span></h1>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hermit\">Hermit</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Background_Hermit_Icon.png/120px-Background_Hermit_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Background_Hermit_Icon.png/180px-Background_Hermit_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Background_Hermit_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Background_Hermit_Icon.png/120px-Background_Hermit_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Background_Hermit_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">A life spent in seclusion grants a clear mind, but makes the chaos of society distasteful.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sailor\">Sailor</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Background_Sailor_Icon.png/120px-Background_Sailor_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Background_Sailor_Icon.png/180px-Background_Sailor_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/02/Background_Sailor_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Background_Sailor_Icon.png/120px-Background_Sailor_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Background_Sailor_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">You are pushed by greed and wanderlust, ever curious, seeking hoards and wonders unknown. Finding secret treasures opens the path to new discoveries.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\"Astral_Zealot_.28Lae.27zel.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Astral_Zealot_(Lae'zel)\">Astral Zealot (Lae'zel)</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Laezel_Icon.png/120px-Laezel_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Laezel_Icon.png/180px-Laezel_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d1/Laezel_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Laezel_Icon.png/120px-Laezel_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Laezel_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Drafted from your crèche into a military life, a taste for violence and a love for the githyanki ruler, Vlaakith, were seeded and nurtured within you. Now you are an agent for Vlaakith on the Material Plane, working toward the advancement of your species.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>In the release version of the game, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/38px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/50px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lae'zel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\">Lae'zel</a> has the <a href=\"/wiki/Soldier\" title=\"Soldier\">Soldier</a> background instead.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Blade_of_Frontiers_.28Wyll.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Blade_of_Frontiers_(Wyll)\">Blade of Frontiers (Wyll)</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Wyll_Icon.png/120px-Wyll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Wyll_Icon.png/180px-Wyll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9b/Wyll_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Wyll_Icon.png/120px-Wyll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Wyll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Sleek as a leopard and bold as a bear with an empty belly, you have developed a reputation that grows and shifts along the Sword Coast. However, a discontent has settled in you, tangling your present in the cruel and complicated details of your past.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>In the release version of the game, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/38px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/50px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wyll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a> has the <a href=\"/wiki/Folk_Hero\" title=\"Folk Hero\">Folk Hero</a> background instead.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Blood_War_Veteran_.28Karlach.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Blood_War_Veteran_(Karlach)\">Blood War Veteran (Karlach)</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Karlach_Icon.png/120px-Karlach_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Karlach_Icon.png/180px-Karlach_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/Karlach_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Karlach_Icon.png/120px-Karlach_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Karlach_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Conscripted by an archdevil to fight in the Blood War against insane and horrifying demons, you emerged fiery and hardened as the core of a furnace. Escaping to the Material Plane, you have left the madness of war behind. But its burning squalling specter still haunts your waking dreams.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>In the release version of the game, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/38px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/50px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a> has the <a href=\"/wiki/Outlander\" title=\"Outlander\">Outlander</a> background instead.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Cloistered_Stray_.28Shadowheart.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cloistered_Stray_(Shadowheart)\">Cloistered Stray (Shadowheart)</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadowheart_Icon.png/120px-Shadowheart_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadowheart_Icon.png/180px-Shadowheart_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Shadowheart_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadowheart_Icon.png/120px-Shadowheart_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shadowheart_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Adopted into a religious convent as a child, you grew up in the warm yet rigorous embrace of the faithful. Their tutelage was rigorous, too. Not much room for warmth, though, and you have found your heart yearning for fulfillment beyond the cloister, your boots for cobbles new.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>In the release version of the game, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a> has the <a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte\" title=\"Acolyte\">Acolyte</a> background instead.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Grove_Tender_.28Halsin.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grove_Tender_(Halsin)\">Grove Tender (Halsin)</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Halsin_Icon.png/120px-Halsin_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Halsin_Icon.png/180px-Halsin_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/a1/Halsin_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Halsin_Icon.png/120px-Halsin_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Halsin_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Master over a verdant grove that was home to life of all varieties, you have lived a life of peace-making and pain-mending. Forsaking the grove was difficult, but necessary, for the safety of the natural world is in jeopardy, and it is the duty of those with green thumbs and greener souls to aid it.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>In the release version of the game, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/25px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/38px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/50px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halsin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/25px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\">Halsin</a> has the <a href=\"/wiki/Outlander\" title=\"Outlander\">Outlander</a> background instead.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Legend_of_Baldur.27s_Gate_.28Minsc.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Legend_of_Baldur's_Gate_(Minsc)\">Legend of Baldur's Gate (Minsc)</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Minsc.png/120px-Minsc.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Minsc.png/180px-Minsc.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/06/Minsc.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Minsc.png/120px-Minsc.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Minsc.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">If evil is a nose you are fist squashing it flat. Such is the legend surrounding you in Baldur's Gate: a hero of the most boisterous variety, armed to the teeth, and packing a tiny space hamster.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>In the release version of the game, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/25px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/38px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/50px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minsc\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/25px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">Minsc</a> has the <a href=\"/wiki/Folk_Hero\" title=\"Folk Hero\">Folk Hero</a> background instead.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Trickster_Hedonist_.28Astarion.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trickster_Hedonist_(Astarion)\">Trickster Hedonist (Astarion)</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Astarion_Icon.png/120px-Astarion_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Astarion_Icon.png/180px-Astarion_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/be/Astarion_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Astarion_Icon.png/120px-Astarion_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Astarion_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Looking at you, people see someone eloquent, experienced, and a little dangerous. There's a sensuality to you that people admire, and you've made use of that fact, oh yes. If ever there was an emblem for night and all its dark promise, surely that is you.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>In the release version of the game, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/25px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/38px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/50px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astarion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/25px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a> has the <a href=\"/wiki/Charlatan\" title=\"Charlatan\">Charlatan</a> background instead.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Underdark_Exile_.28Minthara.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Underdark_Exile_(Minthara)\">Underdark Exile (Minthara)</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Minthara.png/120px-Minthara.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Minthara.png/180px-Minthara.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/a3/Minthara.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Minthara.png/120px-Minthara.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Minthara.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">An apostate who has renounced not one, but two faiths, you find yourself adrift in a world where the Gods are real, certainly, but untrustworthy. What does it mean to live outside of church doctrine, outside cultist dogma? It is up to you to find that out for yourself.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>In the release version of the game, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/25px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/38px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/50px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minthara\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/25px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara</a> has the <a href=\"/wiki/Noble\" title=\"Noble\">Noble</a> background instead.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Wizard_of_Waterdeep_.28Gale.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Wizard_of_Waterdeep_(Gale)\">Wizard of Waterdeep (Gale)</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Gale_Icon.png/120px-Gale_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Gale_Icon.png/180px-Gale_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Gale_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Gale_Icon.png/120px-Gale_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Gale_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Bookish and ambitious, you rose to prominence among the upper crust of spellcasters in the thriving metropolis of Waterdeep. Displaced from that comfortable refined life, you find yourself adapting to a new one on the adventurers' road.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>In the release version of the game, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a> has the <a href=\"/wiki/Sage\" title=\"Sage\">Sage</a> background instead.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"World-Wise_Heroine_.28Jaheira.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"World-Wise_Heroine_(Jaheira)\">World-Wise Heroine (Jaheira)</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Jaheira.png/120px-Jaheira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Jaheira.png/180px-Jaheira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9f/Jaheira.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Jaheira.png/120px-Jaheira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Jaheira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Veteran to a host of world-threatening conflicts, you have shrugged off the very idea of retirement. Peppermints and rocking chairs are for the infirm, and your muscle and mind are still as hard and strong as steel. Besides, young adventurers are headstrong - they need a little wisdom now and then.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>In the release version of the game, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/38px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/50px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jaheira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\">Jaheira</a> has the <a href=\"/wiki/Soldier\" title=\"Soldier\">Soldier</a> background instead.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715002606\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.101 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.105 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4824/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 85758/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 41997/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 10/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 24203/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1185506/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   75.831      1 -total\n 47.61%   36.101     44 Template:Trim\n 35.92%   27.235     12 Template:Quote_background\n 34.73%   26.337     12 Template:NoExcerpt\n 31.93%   24.213     12 Template:Quote_fancy\n 31.03%   23.532      1 Template:Legacy_content\n 30.15%   22.866      1 Template:Ambox\n 26.86%   20.366     10 Template:CharLink\n 19.77%   14.990     10 Template:Icon_link\n 18.68%   14.163     10 Template:Icon_text\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:48378-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715002606 and revision id 340887. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}